e=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\"></span>\r\n<span>Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Both!\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Both!\"></span>\r\n<span>Both!</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Probably not.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Probably not.\"></span>\r\n<span>Probably not.</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be.</div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.1158270743\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be? This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be. \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.305988350\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?  \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Your E-mail \r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1862046737\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Your E-mail   \" aria-required title=\"\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"draftResponse\" value=\"[,,&quot;-5798391077699861475&quot;]\r\n\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"pageHistory\" value=\"0\">\r\n\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"fbzx\" value=\"-5798391077699861475\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><table><tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block\">\r\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">\r\n<div style=\"color:#666\">Never submit passwords through Google Forms.</div></td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table></div></ol></form></div>\r\n<div><div></div>\r\n<div><div></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"margin-top:2em\"><span>Powered by</span>\r\n<a href=\"http://drive.google.com\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:middle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://drive.google.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469204802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2peCBxiFHnguAZUxJSsOKr\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/vsylq52JJYrBNN2ojhdRFkUxISPrD60